{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17397","headline":"工部发引日属伤足卧疾不遂执绋 · 权德舆","name":"工部发引日属伤足卧疾不遂执绋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子春伤足日，况有寝门哀。\n元伯归全去，无由白马来。\n笳箫里巷咽，龟筮墓田开。\n片石潺湲泪，含悲叙史才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}